{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"DocManaga Developer Portal","text":"<p>Welcome to the DocManaga Developer Platform.</p> <p>DocManaga provides a secure document management API that allows businesses to store, manage, and share documents programmatically.</p>"},{"location":"#key-features","title":"Key Features","text":"<ul> <li>Upload and store documents</li> <li>Secure document sharing</li> <li>Password protection</li> <li>Merge multiple documents</li> <li>Download and manage files</li> </ul>"},{"location":"#base-api-url","title":"Base API URL","text":"<p><code>https://api.docmanaga.com/v1</code></p>"},{"location":"#quick-example","title":"Quick Example","text":"<pre><code>curl -X GET https://api.docmanaga.com/v1/documents \\\n    -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\"\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"getting-started/","title":"Getting Started","text":"<p>This guide helps you start using the DocManaga API.</p>"},{"location":"getting-started/#authentication","title":"Authentication","text":"<p>All API requests require an API key.</p> <p>Example header:</p> <p>Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY</p>"},{"location":"getting-started/#base-url","title":"Base URL","text":"<p>https://api.docmanaga.com/v1</p>"},{"location":"getting-started/#first-request","title":"First Request","text":"<pre><code>curl -X GET https://api.docmanaga.com/v1/documents \\\n    -H \"Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\"\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"use-cases/","title":"Use Cases","text":""},{"location":"api/create-document/","title":"Create Document","text":""},{"location":"api/delete-document/","title":"Delete Document","text":""},{"location":"api/download-document/","title":"Download Document","text":""},{"location":"api/get-document/","title":"Get Document","text":""},{"location":"api/get-documents/","title":"Get All Documents","text":